6. Compress String (Run Length Encoding)

Input

aaabbcccc

Output

a3b2c4
s = input()

ans = ""
count = 1

for i in range(1, len(s)):
    if s[i] == s[i-1]:
        count += 1
    else:
        ans += s[i-1] + str(count)
        count = 1

ans += s[-1] + str(count)

print(ans)

